graph TD
    subgraph Conversation Memory Store Architecture
        Client([Client Application]) --> API[Memory Management API]

        API --> Core[Memory Store Controller]

        subgraph Memory Tiers
            direction TB

            subgraph Short-Term Memory
                BWM[Buffer Window Memory]
                desc1[Keeps last N verbatim turns]
                BWM --- desc1
            end

            subgraph Mid-Term Memory
                SM[Summary Memory]
                desc2[Rolling conversational summary]
                SM --- desc2

                HCT[Hierarchical Condensing Tier]
                desc3[Aggregates older summaries]
                HCT --- desc3

                SM --> HCT
            end

            subgraph Long-Term Memory
                EM[Entity Memory]
                desc4[Extracted facts & user profiles]
                EM --- desc4

                VSR[Vector Semantic Recall Index]
                desc5[Embeddings for relevance search]
                VSR --- desc5
            end
        end

        Core --> BWM
        Core --> SM
        Core --> EM
        Core --> VSR

        BWM -. Triggers .-> SM

        subgraph Storage Layer
            DB[(Operational DB)]
            VDB[(Vector DB)]
        end

        BWM --> DB
        SM --> DB
        HCT --> DB
        EM --> DB
        VSR --> VDB
    end

    style desc1 fill:none,stroke:none
    style desc2 fill:none,stroke:none
    style desc3 fill:none,stroke:none
    style desc4 fill:none,stroke:none
    style desc5 fill:none,stroke:none
